"Connect the box to this computer with a USB cable." = "用 USB 线把盒子接到这台电脑上。";
"Then this computer reaches the box without the cable: over the local network, or through the VibeBuddy Relay when you're elsewhere." = "这样不插线也能连到盒子：在同一个网络里走局域网，人在别处时通过 VibeBuddy 中转。";
