"Couldn't join (%@). Check the network name and password, then join again." = "没能加入（%@）。检查一下网络名和密码，再加入一次。";
"Joined · %@" = "已加入 · %@";
"Joining… This can take up to 15 seconds." = "正在加入…最多要等 15 秒左右。";
