"The box can't find this network. It only joins 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi: check the name, and that the box is in range." = "盒子找不到这个网络。它只能连 2.4 GHz 的 Wi-Fi：检查一下网络名，以及盒子是否在信号范围内。";
