"Voice commands are answered by Codex on this computer, and it isn't signed in. Run `codex login` in a terminal and sign in. This tab notices within half a minute." = "语音指令由这台电脑上的 Codex 来回答，但它还没登录。在终端里运行 `codex login` 登录即可。半分钟内这一页会自己更新。";
"How to install the Codex CLI" = "如何安装 Codex CLI";
"Answered by" = "由谁回答";
"Automatic" = "自动";
