"Voice needs Claude Code" = "语音需要 Claude Code";
"Voice commands are answered by Claude Code on this computer, and it isn't installed. Install Claude Code; you don't need to sign in to it. This tab notices within half a minute." = "语音指令由这台电脑上的 Claude Code 来回答，但它还没安装。装好 Claude Code 即可，不用登录。半分钟内这一页会自己更新。";
